# 61. Performance

Design for:

* parameterized queries
* proper indexes
* pagination
* projection queries
* async EF Core operations
* avoiding N+1 queries
* avoiding unnecessary Include chains
* no SELECT *
* appropriate database connection pooling

For list APIs, project directly into DTOs where possible.

Do not retrieve entire entity graphs when only summary information is required.

