# 64. Required database deliverables

Before implementing APIs, generate:

1. SQL schema design.
2. Complete table list.
3. Complete column dictionary.
4. PK/FK relationship map.
5. Index strategy.
6. Unique constraint strategy.
7. Tenant isolation strategy.
8. Soft-delete strategy.
9. Audit strategy.
10. Concurrency strategy.
11. Outbox strategy.
12. Seed data.
13. EF Core entity classes.
14. EF Core configurations.
15. Initial migration.
16. Database initialization/seed implementation.
17. ER diagram.
18. Sample SQL queries for major access patterns.

Only after these are complete should API implementation begin.

